---
// Default vignette for `kind: code` works. Terminal build log. Sized to
// fill its container via viewBox-less `<pre>`; the route stylesheet
// (`routes/works.css`) sizes the wrapper. Inlined SVG/text so the
// vignette stays zero-request and `currentColor` flows through.
---

<pre
  class="work-art-terminal"
  role="img"
  aria-label="terminal build log">{`$ pnpm dev  ──────────────────────────╮
  ✓ astro  v6.4.2 ready               │
  ✓ Local  http://localhost:4321/     │
  ✓ Network  use --host to expose     │
  ✓ watching for file changes...      │
  ────────────────────────────────────╯`}</pre>
